au14-forge-full = The crucible is full - no more room to melt anything in.
au14-forge-inserted = You feed { $count } into the crucible, adding molten { $reagent }.

au14-forge-grabbed = You grip the crucible with the tongs.
au14-forge-dropped = You set the crucible down with the tongs.
au14-forge-tongs-empty = The tongs aren't gripping anything.
au14-forge-nothing-to-pour = That's not something you can pour.
au14-forge-burn-hand = You burn your hand!
au14-forge-furnace-occupied = Something's already sitting in that furnace.
au14-forge-attached = You set the crucible in the furnace with the tongs.

au14-forge-pour-empty = There's nothing molten in the crucible to pour.
au14-forge-pour-cold = It's only at { $temperature }°, and needs at least { $required }° before it'll pour - still solid.
au14-forge-poured = You tip the crucible and pour the melt out.

au14-forge-examine-empty = It's empty.
au14-forge-examine-contents = It holds [color=orange]{ $volume }u[/color] of molten metal.
au14-forge-examine-temperature = It reads [color=orange]{ $temperature }°[/color].
au14-forge-examine-not-in-furnace = It isn't sitting in a furnace - it won't heat up.
au14-forge-examine-heating = It's sitting in a lit furnace, heating up.
au14-forge-examine-cold-furnace = It's sitting in a furnace, but the furnace isn't lit.
au14-forge-examine-on-anvil = It's sitting on an anvil - it'll only cool down there, not heat up.

au14-mold-full = The mold is already full.
au14-mold-cooling = A casting is still cooling in there - wait for it to finish.
au14-mold-scrap = It doesn't look right - the mix isn't anything you recognise. You'd need to cut it out and try again.
au14-mold-cast-cooling = The mold hisses and starts to cool - looks like it's shaping up to a { $name }.
au14-mold-cast-ready = The mold's stopped hissing - the { $name } inside looks ready to pull out.
au14-mold-cast-done = You pull a finished { $name } out of the mold, cool enough to handle.
au14-mold-cleared = You cut the ruined pour out of the mold.

au14-mold-verb-extract = Extract casting

au14-mold-examine-empty = It's empty, ready for a pour.
au14-mold-examine-scrap = It's got a ruined, unrecognisable lump of cooled metal in it - needs cutting out.
au14-mold-examine-cooling = A fresh casting is cooling inside it.
au14-mold-examine-ready = A finished casting is sitting inside it, ready to be pulled out.
